<figure id="A4.T5" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A4.T5.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 5</span>: </span><span id="A4.T5.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Comparison of expert selection strategies on GLUE benchmarks. Best results per dataset are <span id="A4.T5.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_underline ltx_font_bold">underlined</span>. Relative threshold (<math id="A4.T5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta=0.7" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta=0.7</annotation></semantics></math>) achieves the best average performance while using only 1.73 experts on average.</span></figcaption>
