<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A7.T18.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 18</span>: </span><span id="A7.T18.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Object, motion, and spatial reasoning from video using Molmo. Highlighted rows denote our LiME variants.</span></figcaption>
<table id="A7.T18.5" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
